From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrakDv <business@drak.gg>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:20:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: patches ported from other forks
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Squashed from Leaf ver/26.3 (Winds-Studio/Leaf@60c5729), minecraft patches:

- Pufferfish: Optimize mob spawning (Kevin Raneri)
- Pufferfish: Dynamic Activation of Brain (Paul Sauve)
- Fix Pufferfish and Purpur patches (Dreeam)
- Purpur: Configurable server mod name (Dreeam)
- Configurable server GUI name (Dreeam)
- Configurable vanilla username check (Dreeam)
- Remove Spigot check for broken BungeeCord configurations (Dreeam)
- Remove UseItemOnPacket Too Far check (Dreeam)
- Remove change non-editable sign warning (Dreeam)
- KeYi: Add an option for spigot item merging mechanism (nostalgic853)
- Carpet-Fixes: Optimized getBiome method (nostalgic853)
- Carpet-Fixes: Use optimized RecipeManager (nostalgic853)
- Akarin: Save Json list asynchronously (ㄗㄠˋ ㄑㄧˊ)
- Slice: Smooth Teleports (Cryptite)
- Parchment: Make FixLight use action bar (Blast-MC)
- Petal: reduce work done by game event system (peaches94)
- Reduce canSee work (Dreeam)
- Fix sprint glitch (pixelNightly)
- Configurable movement speed of more entities (Dreeam)
- Faster sequencing of futures for chunk structure gen (Dreeam)
- Luminol: Configurable region format framework (MrHua269)
- Plazma: Add some missing Pufferfish configurations (AlphaKR93)
- Plazma: Add missing purpur configuration options (AlphaKR93)
- SparklyPaper: Skip "distanceToSqr" call in "ServerEntity#sendChanges" if the delta movement hasn't changed (MrPowerGamerBR)
- SparklyPaper: Skip "MapItem#update()" if the map does not have the CraftMapRenderer present (MrPowerGamerBR)
- SparklyPaper: Optimize "canSee" checks (MrPowerGamerBR)
- Polpot: Make egg and snowball can knockback player (lilingfengdev)
- Remove useless creating stats json bases on player name logic (Dreeam)
- Improve Purpur AFK system (Dreeam)
- Virtual thread support for chat executor (HaHaWTH)
- Virtual thread support for download pool (Taiyou06)
- Mirai: Configurable chat message signatures (etil2jz)
- Matter: Secure Seed (Apehum)
- Matter: Secure Seed command (Apehum)
- Faster random generator (HaHaWTH)
- Don't save primed tnt entity (nostalfinals)
- Don't save falling block entity (nostalfinals)
- Configurable connection message (Dreeam)
- Configurable unknown command message (Dreeam)
- Remove stream in BlockBehaviour cache blockstate (Dreeam)
- Remove stream in entity visible effects filter (Dreeam)
- Remove stream and double iteration in enough deep sleeping player check (Dreeam)
- Remove stream in trial spawner ticking (Dreeam)
- Remove stream in BehaviorUtils (HaHaWTH)
- Remove stream in YieldJobSite (HaHaWTH)
- Remove stream in PlayerSensor (HaHaWTH)
- Remove stream in GolemSensor (HaHaWTH)
- Remove stream in GateBehavior (Taiyou06)
- Remove stream in matchingSlot (Taiyou06)
- Remove stream in villagers (Taiyou06)
- Remove stream on updateConnectedPlayersWithinRange (Taiyou06)
- Remove stream on PlayerDetector (Taiyou06)
- Remove stream in MobSensor (Taiyou06)
- Remove stream in TemptingSensor (Taiyou06)
- Remove stream in CraftWorld#spawnParticle (Dreeam)
- Replace Entity active effects map with optimized collection (Dreeam)
- Replace criterion map with optimized collection (Dreeam)
- Replace brain with optimized collection (HaHaWTH)
- Use caffeine cache for kickPermission instead of using google.common.cache (Dreeam)
- Fix MC-65198 (HaHaWTH)
- Fix MC-200418 (HaHaWTH)
- Fix MC-223153 (HaHaWTH)
- Fix MC-270656 (HaHaWTH)
- Fix MC-299642 (HaHaWTH)
- Fix MC-152094 (HaHaWTH)
- Configurable player knockback zombie (Dreeam)
- Paper PR: Prevent zombie reinforcements loading chunks (Newwind)
- Paper PR: Fix some beacon event issues (Warrior)
- Dont send useless entity packets (William Blake Galbreath)
- optimize attribute (hayanesuru)
- Nitori: Async playerdata saving (Dreeam)
- Optimize nearby alive players for spawning (Dreeam)
- Cache blockstate cache array (HaHaWTH)
- Optimize Entity distanceToSqr (HaHaWTH)
- EMC: Don't use snapshots for TileEntity::getOwner (Aikar)
- Cache tile entity position (Dreeam)
- C2ME: Reduce Allocations (Taiyou06)
- Lithium: fast util (Taiyou06)
- Lithium: cached iterate outwards (Taiyou06)
- Use faster and thread-safe ban list date format parsing (Dreeam)
- Cache chunk key (Dreeam)
- Configurable tripwire dupe (Dreeam)
- Paper PR: Fix MC-117075: Block Entities Unload Lag Spike (MrPowerGamerBR)
- Sepals: Rearrange the attackable conditions (cao-awa)
- SparklyPaper: Skip dirty stats copy when requesting player stats (MrPowerGamerBR)
- SparklyPaper: Reset dirty flag when loading maps from the disk (MrPowerGamerBR)
- Optimize checking nearby players for spawning (Taiyou06)
- Optimize baby villager sensor (Taiyou06)
- Only player pushable (Dreeam)
- Remove iterators from Inventory (Taiyou06)
- optimize mob despawn (hayanesuru)
- Slightly optimise getNearestPlayer (Taiyou06)
- Bulk writes to writeLongArray during chunk loading (Taiyou06)
- Improve sorting in SortedArraySet (Taiyou06)
- Rewrite ClientboundLightUpdatePacketData (Taiyou06)
- Spawner Configurations (Taiyou06)

Dropped in favour of Swift: Petal: Async Pathfinding (Swift async pathfinding).

